[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3195368347","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109709#issuecomment-3195368347","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109709","id":3195368347,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6-dXOb","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-18T06:57:29Z","updated_at":"2025-08-18T06:57:29Z","body":"Currently, it seems to be hardcoded into window border styleboxes (`embedded_border` and `embedded_unfocused_border`).","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3195368347/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4777456257","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109709#issuecomment-4777456257","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109709","id":4777456257,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABHMIygQ","user":{"login":"hhyyrylainen","id":3796411,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM3OTY0MTE=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3796411?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hhyyrylainen","html_url":"https://github.com/hhyyrylainen","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hhyyrylainen/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hhyyrylainen/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hhyyrylainen/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hhyyrylainen/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hhyyrylainen/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hhyyrylainen/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hhyyrylainen/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hhyyrylainen/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hhyyrylainen/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-23T08:55:01Z","updated_at":"2026-06-23T08:55:40Z","body":"I might not have exactly the same problem, but I think I've found a related issue: if I change the default theme font size so that it is bigger then eventually it clips outside the area reserved for Window titles. So the Window titles should increase their minimum height based on the font size so that there is no clipping.\n\n<img width=\"1152\" height=\"648\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/94c62404-6e6c-4cd0-aaf8-1a61539ab499\" />\n\nThis is the code that can trigger the problem when showing any window after it:\n\n```gdscript\nfunc _on_big_pressed() -> void:\n    _set_default_font_size(int(round(20 * 2.5)))\n    \n    var dialog = AcceptDialog.new()\n    dialog.title = \"This is too tall text!\"\n    dialog.dialog_text = \"The title of this dialog doesn't fit\\ndue to increased font size\"\n    dialog.dialog_hide_on_ok = true\n    dialog.theme = theme\n    dialog.popup_exclusive_centered(self, Vector2(250, 150))\n\n\nfunc _set_default_font_size(font_size: int) -> void:\n    theme.default_font_size = font_size\n```\n\nIf anyone needs it, I created an example project showing the issue with minimal code:\n\n[tall-window-title.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/29243243/tall-window-title.zip)\n\n\nIf this is not really a \"duplicate\" of this issue, I can open a separate issue as well with this info.\n\nEdit: oh and yeah I just tested with the new Godot 4.7 version and it still works like this.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4777456257/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]